<%- include('partials/head') %>
<p><a href="/admin/profiles/<%= row.id %>">← Manage profile</a></p><h1>Share your card</h1><p><%= row.draft.first_name %> <%= row.draft.last_name %></p>
<section class="panel narrow"><h2>Page QR code</h2><p>The link stays the same when the profile is updated.</p><img class="qr" src="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.png" alt="QR code to open the card" width="300" height="300"><div class="actions"><a href="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.png?download=1" class="button">Save PNG</a><a href="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.svg?download=1" class="button secondary">Save SVG</a></div>
<label>Permanent link<input value="<%= url %>" readonly id="share-url"></label><div class="actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-copy="#share-url">Copy link</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-share="<%= url %>">Share from your phone</button></div><p role="status" id="copy-status"></p></section>
<section class="panel narrow"><h2>Contact QR code</h2><p>Contains the name, role, organization, phone number (if provided) and page link. A compatible scanner offers to save the contact. The private email address is excluded.</p><img class="qr" src="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.png?mode=contact" alt="QR code containing contact details" width="300" height="300"><div class="actions"><a href="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.png?mode=contact&amp;download=1" class="button">Save contact PNG</a><a href="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.svg?mode=contact&amp;download=1" class="button secondary">Save contact SVG</a></div><p class="notice">Saved or printed copies keep the current details. They cannot be updated or revoked remotely.</p></section>
<% if (brand.mark) { %><section class="panel narrow"><h2>QR customization</h2><p>QR codes include the brand logo on white with high error correction. Choose a color in the profile editor. You can also export them without the logo:</p><div class="actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.png?logo=0&amp;download=1">Page PNG without logo</a><a class="button secondary" href="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.svg?logo=0&amp;download=1">Page SVG without logo</a><a class="button secondary" href="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.png?mode=contact&amp;logo=0&amp;download=1">Contact PNG without logo</a><a class="button secondary" href="/c/<%= row.public_id %>/qr.svg?mode=contact&amp;logo=0&amp;download=1">Contact SVG without logo</a></div></section><% } %>
<p class="notice">QR codes use the domain configured on the server (PUBLIC_ORIGIN). Download them after deploying with HTTPS. Codes already saved or printed with a local address do not change automatically. Importing profiles into a new database assigns new public IDs. Republishing in the same database keeps the link.</p>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
